<td>Tags and a discovery feed</td>\n              <td>Good for subscriptions plus search</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"row\">Footly</th>\n              <td>About 5–15% on sales. Payouts from $10, weekly.</td>\n              <td>Niche feet marketplace</td>\n              <td>Useful after you know your prices</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"vip-guides\" aria-labelledby=\"guides-h\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"guides-h\">All VIP guides</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"vip-grid\"><article class=\"vip-rich vip-guide\"><a class=\"vip-card\" href=\"https://www.dark-ero.store/blog/how-to-take-feet-pics/\"><span class=\"vip-body\"><span class=\"vip-kicker\"><span class=\"vip-pill\">Feet</span></span><h3>How to Take Feet Pics</h3><p>A phone, side window light and a plain background are enough to shoot feet pics that sell. Crop out mail, screens and mirrors before you upload a set.</p><span class=\"vip-foot\"><span class=\"vip-date\">Nov 10, 2026</span><span class=\"vip-cta\">Read →</span></span></span></a></article><article class=\"vip-rich vip-guide\"><a class=\"vip-card\" href=\"https://www.dark-ero.store/blog/is-selling-feet-pics-legal/\"><span class=\"vip-body\"><span class=\"vip-kicker\"><span class=\"vip-pill\">Feet</span></span><h3>Is Selling Feet Pics Legal?</h3><p>Adults in the US can generally sell lawful photos of their own feet. Age, consent, shop rules and tax still apply, and this page is not legal advice.</p><span class=\"vip-foot\"><span class=\"vip-date\">Nov 10, 2026</span><span class=\"vip-cta\">Read →</span></span></span></a></article><article class=\"vip-rich vip-guide\"><a class=\"vip-card\" href=\"https://www.dark-ero.store/blog/feetfinder-bio-ideas/\"><span class=\"vip-body\"><span class=\"vip-kicker\"><span class=\"vip-pill\">Feet</span></span><h3>FeetFinder Bio Ideas</h3><p>A FeetFinder bio names your niche, what is for sale, and one boundary in a few lines. Leave out your name, city, phone, email and any off-site link.</p><span class=\"vip-foot\"><span class=\"vip-date\">Nov 10, 2026</span><span class=\"vip-cta\">Read →</span></span></span></a></article><article class=\"vip-rich vip-guide\"><a class=\"vip-card\" href=\"https://www.dark-ero.store/blog/feetfinder-login/\"><span class=\"vip-body\"><span class=\"vip-kicker\"><span class=\"vip-pill\">Feet</span></span><h3>FeetFinder Login</h3><p>Buyers and sellers use one FeetFinder sign-in, with email or username plus a password. Reset from that page, and never type the password into a store app.</p><span class=\"vip-foot\"><span class=\"vip-date\">Nov 10, 2026</span><span class=\"vip-cta\">Read →</span></span></span></a></article><article class=\"vip-rich vip-guide\"><a class=\"vip-card\" href=\"https://www.dark-ero.store/blog/how-to-delete-feetfinder-account/\"><span class=\"vip-body\"><span class=\"vip-kicker\"><span class=\"vip-pill\">Privacy</span></span><h3>How to Delete a FeetFinder Account</h3><p>Delete a FeetFinder account from the Profile tab. Subscriptions run out first, unpaid earnings are paid out, and support is hello@feetfinder.com.</p><span class=\"vip-foot\"><span class=\"vip-date\">Nov 10, 2026</span><span class=\"vip-cta\">Read →</span></span></span></a></article><article class=\"vip-rich vip-guide\"><a class=\"vip-card\" href=\"https://www.dark-ero.store/blog/sell-feet-pics-as-a-guy/\"><span class=\"vip-body\"><span class=\"vip-kicker\"><span class=\"vip-pill\">Feet</span></span><h3>Sell Feet Pics as a Guy</h3><p>Men sell feet pics on FeetFinder at the same 85 or 90 percent as anyone else. No shop publishes a male-only income, so ignore fixed monthly promises.</p><span class=\"vip-foot\"><span class=\"vip-date\">Nov 10, 2026</span><span class=\"vip-cta\">Read →</span></span></span></a></article><article class=\"vip-rich vip-guide\"><a class=\"vip-card\" href=\"https://www.dark-ero.store/blog/feetfinder-taxes/\"